<title>UK: Abbey withdraws 6.99 pct fixed rate mortgage.</title>
<headline>Abbey withdraws 6.99 pct fixed rate mortgage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank Abbey National said on Monday it would withdraw its current mortgage rate of 6.99 percent fixed until July 31, 2002 at close of business on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Due to the popularity of the fixed rate, there will be no further funds available after the close of business on this date,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
